    {
      "country": "AS",
      "status": "official_procedure",
      "sources": [
        {
          "authority": "U.S. Government Accountability Office",
          "title": "GAO-26-107811: Customs models in U.S. territories",
          "url": "https://files.gao.gov/reports/GAO-26-107811/index.html",
          "topic": "territory"
        },
        {
          "authority": "American Samoa Bar Association, American Samoa Code Annotated",
          "title": "A.S.C.A. 27.1005 Customs entry and declaration",
          "url": "https://asbar.org/code-annotated/27-1005-customs-entry-and-declaration/",
          "topic": "procedure"
        },
        {
          "authority": "American Samoa Bar Association, American Samoa Code Annotated",
          "title": "A.S.C.A. 27.1017 Furnishing of invoices to treasurer",
          "url": "https://asbar.org/code-annotated/27-1017-furnishing-of-invoices-to-treasurer/",
          "topic": "procedure"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": [
        {
          "topic": "territory",
          "textJa": "米領サモアの税関当局が現地制度で貨物を処理する。米国本土の通常輸入申告を流用せず、輸入地と貨物の種類を伝えて現地当局に申告方法を確認する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://files.gao.gov/reports/GAO-26-107811/index.html"
          ]
        },
        {
          "topic": "procedure",
          "textJa": "A.S.C.A. 27.1005の税関申告を行い、27.1017のインボイス提出要件を確認する。搬出前の検査・許可についてAmerican Samoa Customsに確認する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://asbar.org/code-annotated/27-1005-customs-entry-and-declaration/",
            "https://asbar.org/code-annotated/27-1017-furnishing-of-invoices-to-treasurer/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "country": "AU",
      "status": "official_procedure",
      "sources": [
        {
          "authority": "Australian Border Force",
          "title": "Import declarations",
          "url": "https://www.abf.gov.au/importing-exporting-and-manufacturing/importing/how-to-import/import-declaration",
          "topic": "procedure"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry",
          "title": "Before you import goods to Australia",
          "url": "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/before",
          "topic": "restriction"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry",
          "title": "External territories",
          "url": "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/goods/external-territories",
          "topic": "restriction"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": [
        {
          "topic": "procedure",
          "textJa": "国内消費向け貨物の合計価額が1,000豪ドルを超える場合はN10をICSで提出するか、署名済み書類をABF窓口に提出する。窓口提出の航空・海上貨物はB650、国際郵便はB374を確認する。1,000豪ドル以下の航空・海上貨物はSACを確認し、国際郵便とカルネにはSACを使用しない。輸入許可が必要な貨物はN10または長様式SACを使用する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.abf.gov.au/importing-exporting-and-manufacturing/importing/how-to-import/import-declaration"
          ]
        },
        {
          "topic": "restriction",
          "textJa": "出発地・原産地、品目、梱包材に応じてBICONでバイオセキュリティ条件を調べ、必要な輸入許可、証明書、処理、検査条件を発送前に確認する。クリスマス島、ココス（キーリング）諸島、ノーフォーク島はそれぞれの条件を照会する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/before",
            "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/goods/external-territories"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "country": "CC",
      "status": "official_procedure",
      "sources": [
        {
          "authority": "Australian Border Force",
          "title": "Australian Customs Notice 2026/11",
          "url": "https://www.abf.gov.au/help-and-support-subsite/CustomsNotices/2026-11.pdf",
          "topic": "territory"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry",
          "title": "External territories",
          "url": "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/goods/external-territories",
          "topic": "restriction"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry",
          "title": "Indian Ocean Territories: Christmas and Cocos (Keeling) Islands",
          "url": "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/biosecurity-trade/import/goods/external-territories/iot",
          "topic": "restriction"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Australian Department of Agriculture, Fisheries and Forestry",
          "title": "First points of entry: seaport locations",
          "url": "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/biosecurity-trade/aircraft-vessels-military/vessels/first-point-entry-and-non-first-point-entry/seaport-locations",
          "topic": "procedure"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": [
        {
          "topic": "territory",
          "textJa": "ココス（キーリング）諸島と豪州本土間の貨物は、ABF通知2026/11で、出入境報告、貨物申告、適用される税関・税務の取扱いを確認する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.abf.gov.au/help-and-support-subsite/CustomsNotices/2026-11.pdf"
          ]
        },
        {
          "topic": "restriction",
          "textJa": "ココス（キーリング）諸島の個別の条件付許容品目規則を照会する。規則の対象外の貨物はBICONで許可を申請し、豪州本土を出る前に許可を取得する。必要な処理、検査、証明は品目別に照合する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/import/goods/external-territories",
            "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/biosecurity-trade/import/goods/external-territories/iot"
          ]
        },
        {
          "topic": "procedure",
          "textJa": "DAFFの指定海港の一般貨物と貨物コンテナの受付区分を照合する。指定表が列挙するコンテナは20フィートのもの。その他のコンテナは荷揚げ前に許可の要否を照会する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.agriculture.gov.au/biosecurity-trade/aircraft-vessels-military/vessels/first-point-entry-and-non-first-point-entry/seaport-locations"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "country": "CK",
      "status": "official_procedure",
      "sources": [
        {
          "authority": "Cook Islands Ministry of Finance and Economic Management",
          "title": "Importing",
          "url": "https://www.mfem.gov.ck/importing",
          "topic": "procedure"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Cook Islands Ministry of Agriculture",
          "title": "Biosecurity: importing",
          "url": "https://agriculture.gov.ck/biosecurity/importing/",
          "topic": "restriction"
        },
        {
          "authority": "Cook Islands Ministry of Agriculture",
          "title": "Biosecurity register and forms",
          "url": "https://agriculture.gov.ck/biosecurity/register-forms/",
          "topic": "restriction"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": [
        {
          "topic": "procedure",
          "textJa": "海上・航空・郵便等の輸入貨物は、免除が確認された場合を除き、現地の認可通関業者または申告者を通じて到着前または到着時に輸入申告する。税関に申告免除と受理条件を照会する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://www.mfem.gov.ck/importing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "topic": "restriction",
          "textJa": "動物・植物等の規制対象貨物は農業省Biosecurityに品目別の輸入許可と添付証明書を照会し、専用様式を提出する。",
          "sourceUrls": [
            "https://agriculture.gov.ck/biosecurity/importing/",
            "https://agriculture.gov.ck/biosecurity/register-forms/"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
